02:02:38.875 --> 02:02:41.828
BREATHE INTO THE BODY OF THE

02:02:41.828 --> 02:02:44.030
118TH CONGRESS YOUR WORD OF

02:02:44.030 --> 02:02:45.698
TRUTH AND JUSTICE, COMPASSION

02:02:45.698 --> 02:02:47.350
AND WISDOM.

02:02:47.350 --> 02:02:48.668
GIVE EACH MEMBER THE GUIDANCE TO

02:02:48.668 --> 02:02:51.471
BE FAITHFUL STEWARDS OF THIS

02:02:51.471 --> 02:02:54.440
DIVINE TASKING AND TO WIELD THIS

02:02:54.440 --> 02:02:55.458
PRIVILEGE CAREFULLY.

02:02:55.458 --> 02:02:56.909
EVEN AS YOU GRANT US THE FAVOR

02:02:56.909 --> 02:02:59.178
TO SERVE YOU IN THIS PLACE,

02:02:59.178 --> 02:03:01.864
REMIND US THAT AMIDST ALL THE

02:03:01.864 --> 02:03:03.950
DEBATE, YOU WILL ALWAYS HAVE THE

02:03:03.950 --> 02:03:05.568
FINAL WORD.

02:03:05.568 --> 02:03:08.354
AND YOUR WORD IS ALIVE AND

02:03:08.354 --> 02:03:11.057
POWERFUL, SHARPER THAN ANY

02:03:11.057 --> 02:03:11.724
TWO-EDGED SWORD.

02:03:11.724 --> 02:03:14.644
DIVIDE THEN OUR SOULS AND

02:03:14.644 --> 02:03:14.877
SPIRITS.

02:03:14.877 --> 02:03:16.012
DISCERN OUR THOUGHTS AND THE

02:03:16.012 --> 02:03:17.814
INTENTIONS OF OUR HEARTS AND MAY

02:03:17.814 --> 02:03:20.616
THEY BE ACCEPTABLE TO YOU.

02:03:20.616 --> 02:03:21.717
LAY ON THE SHOULDERS OF THESE

02:03:21.717 --> 02:03:24.687
MEN AND WOMEN THE MANTLE OF BOTH

02:03:24.687 --> 02:03:27.323
RESPONSIBILITY AND

02:03:27.323 --> 02:03:27.523
ACCOUNTABILITY.

