02:03:40.353 --> 02:03:42.321
VOICE AND THEN AS THEY UPHOLD

02:03:42.321 --> 02:03:43.689
AND DEFEND THE CONSTITUTION AND

02:03:43.689 --> 02:03:46.359
ITS MORAL PRINCIPLES, GRANT THEM

02:03:46.359 --> 02:03:50.146
STRENGTH AND REASON, PURPOSE AND

02:03:50.146 --> 02:03:50.279
INSIGHT.

02:03:50.279 --> 02:03:53.516
SO BRING THIS 118TH CONGRESS TO

02:03:53.516 --> 02:03:55.818
LIFE AND BREATHE ON US THE

02:03:55.818 --> 02:03:58.454
CREATIVE WORK OF YOUR HOLY

02:03:58.454 --> 02:03:58.621
SPIRIT.

02:03:58.621 --> 02:04:00.173
