02:04:00.173 --> 02:04:03.075
HAND, EARS TO HEAR YOUR WISE

02:04:03.075 --> 02:04:05.344
TRUTH, AND HEARTS TO HOLD FIRMLY

02:04:05.344 --> 02:04:08.998
