02:45:35.449 --> 02:45:36.950
WORK AND WILL SEE YOU THROUGH IT

02:45:36.950 --> 02:45:37.968
THROUGH BECAUSE HE KNOWS THAT

02:45:37.968 --> 02:45:39.653
OUR SUCCESS WILL RAISE THE

02:45:39.653 --> 02:45:40.954
QUALITY OF LIFE FOR OUR

02:45:40.954 --> 02:45:41.938
CONSTITUENTS, CREATING BETTER

02:45:41.938 --> 02:45:44.458
JOBS AND BUILDING SAFER

02:45:44.458 --> 02:45:44.641
COMMUNITIES.

02:45:44.641 --> 02:45:45.926
HE'S GUIDED EVERY STEP OF THE

02:45:45.926 --> 02:45:49.780
WAY BY HIS FAITH, HIS MOM, HIS

02:45:49.780 --> 02:45:51.581
MOM INSTILLED IN HIM.

02:45:51.581 --> 02:45:52.866
SUNDAY MORNINGS WEREN'T ALWAYS

02:45:52.866 --> 02:45:54.317
EASY IN THE JEFFRIES HOUSE.

02:45:54.317 --> 02:45:55.969
THE YOUNG MAN KNEW HE WANTED TO

02:45:55.969 --> 02:45:58.005
BE A LAWYER WOULD ARGUE WITH HIS

02:45:58.005 --> 02:45:59.940
MOM ABOUT GOING TO CHURCH THAT

02:45:59.940 --> 02:46:00.123
DAY.

02:46:00.123 --> 02:46:01.558
BUT FAILURE IS A GOOD TEACHER.

02:46:01.558 --> 02:46:03.910
.

02:46:03.910 --> 02:46:05.078
BUT FAILURE IS A GOOD TEACHER.

02:46:05.078 --> 02:46:06.563
HE LOST THOSE ARGUMENTS AND NOW

02:46:06.563 --> 02:46:09.900
HAKEEM GOES TO CHURCH EVERY

02:46:09.900 --> 02:46:11.618
WEEKEND, SOMETIMES THAT ONE HIS

02:46:11.618 --> 02:46:12.636
CHURCH FAMILY IS AT COLONELLER

02:46:12.636 --> 02:46:15.172
STONE BAPTIST, OR SOMEWHERE ELSE

02:46:15.172 --> 02:46:16.623
IN THE DISTRICT WHERE HE CAN

02:46:16.623 --> 02:46:17.724
MEET HIS CONSTITUENTS WHERE THEY

02:46:17.724 --> 02:46:17.858
CAN.

02:46:17.858 --> 02:46:18.675
