02:46:18.675 --> 02:46:20.844
ON SUNDAYS HE'D GO TO NANNO'S

02:46:20.844 --> 02:46:22.546
HOUSE WHERE THERE WAS AN OPEN

02:46:22.546 --> 02:46:23.747
DOOR AT HIS GRANDMOTHER'S HOUSE

02:46:23.747 --> 02:46:25.065
FOR THE ENTIRE NEIGHBORHOOD AND

02:46:25.065 --> 02:46:27.267
THEIR ELDERS TO COME WITH FOOD

02:46:27.267 --> 02:46:27.918
AND CONVERSATION.

02:46:27.918 --> 02:46:30.771
THE YOUNG HAKEEM LISTENING TO

02:46:30.771 --> 02:46:31.471
EVERYTHING, BUT USUALLY JUST

02:46:31.471 --> 02:46:32.556
TRYING TO CATCH THE SCORE OF THE

02:46:32.556 --> 02:46:34.424
JETS GAME.

02:46:34.424 --> 02:46:36.760
THIS IS WHERE WISDOM GETS PASSED

02:46:36.760 --> 02:46:37.344
DOWN.

02:46:37.344 --> 02:46:38.929
AND NOW GUIDED BY THE FAITH AND

02:46:38.929 --> 02:46:41.364
WISDOM OF LEADERS LIKE JIM

02:46:41.364 --> 02:46:44.768
CLYBURN, GREG MEEKS, JOHN LEWIS,

02:46:44.768 --> 02:47:06.890
STENY HOYER, NANCY PELOSI.

02:47:06.890 --> 02:47:08.742
IT IS SHAPED BY THAT GUIDANCE

02:47:08.742 --> 02:47:10.243
THAT WE ARE PREPARED TO NOMINATE

02:47:10.243 --> 02:47:11.878
A LEADER WHO WILL OPEN THE DOOR

02:47:11.878 --> 02:47:14.164
TO THE NEW GENERATION OF

02:47:14.164 --> 02:47:14.581
LEADERSHIP.

