AND SO MY COLLEAGUES, I RISE TO

04:24:41.555 --> 04:24:43.574
NOMINATE THE MOST TALENTED,

04:24:43.574 --> 04:24:45.843
HARDEST WORKING MEMBER OF THE

04:24:45.843 --> 04:24:47.345
REPUBLICAN CONFERENCE, WHO JUST

04:24:47.345 --> 04:24:49.180
GAVE A SPEECH WITH MORE VISION

04:24:49.180 --> 04:24:52.300
THAN WE HAVE EVER HEARD FROM THE

04:24:52.300 --> 04:24:52.483
ALTERNATIVE.

04:24:52.483 --> 04:24:53.851
I'M NOMINATING JIM JORDAN.

04:24:53.851 --> 04:24:56.921
JIM JORDAN IS HUMBLE.

04:24:56.921 --> 04:25:00.441
PERHAPS TODAY, HUMBLE TO A

04:25:00.441 --> 04:25:00.641
FAULT.

04:25:00.641 --> 04:25:01.993
MAYBE THE RIGHT PERSON FOR THE

04:25:01.993 --> 04:25:03.894
JOB OF SPEAKER OF THE HOUSE

04:25:03.894 --> 04:25:06.747
ISN'T SOMEONE WHO WANTS IT SO

04:25:06.747 --> 04:25:06.914
BAD.

04:25:06.914 --> 04:25:07.832
MAYBE THE RIGHT PERSON FOR THE

04:25:07.832 --> 04:25:09.583
JOB OF SPEAKER OF THE HOUSE

04:25:09.583 --> 04:25:12.086
ISN'T SOMEONE WHO HAS SOLD

04:25:12.086 --> 04:25:13.204
SHARES OF THEMSELVES FOR MORE

04:25:13.204 --> 04:25:15.473
THAN A DECADE TO GET IT.

04:25:15.473 --> 04:25:18.893
MR. GAETZ: MAYBE JIM JORDAN IS

04:25:18.893 --> 04:25:20.461
THE RIGHT PERSON FOR SPEAKER OF

04:25:20.461 --> 04:25:22.430
THE HOUSE BECAUSE HE IS NOT

04:25:22.430 --> 04:25:24.799
BEHOLDEN TO THE LOBBYISTS AND

04:25:24.799 --> 04:25:26.183
SPECIAL INTERESTS WHO HAVE

04:25:26.183 --> 04:25:27.752
CORRUPTED THIS PLACE AND

04:25:27.752 --> 04:25:29.670
CORRUPTED THIS NATION UNDER THE

04:25:29.670 --> 04:25:30.721
LEADERSHIP OF BOTH REPUBLICANS

04:25:30.721 --> 04:25:33.391
AND DEMOCRATS.

04:25:33.391 --> 04:25:34.709
MAYBE JIM JORDAN WOULD BE THE

04:25:34.709 --> 04:25:35.876
RIGHT PERSON FOR SPEAKER OF THE

04:25:35.876 --> 04:25:37.028
HOUSE BECAUSE HE WOULDN'T FIGHT

04:25:37.028 --> 04:25:39.096
US WHEN WE TRY TO GET A TERM

04:25:39.096 --> 04:25:40.247
LIMITS BILL ON THE FLOOR.

04:25:40.247 --> 04:25:41.515
MAYBE JIM JORDAN WOULD BE THE

04:25:41.515 --> 04:25:42.767
RIGHT PERSON BECAUSE HE WOULDN'T

04:25:42.767 --> 04:25:46.037
FIGHT US WHEN WE TRIED TO PUT A

04:25:46.037 --> 04:25:46.988
BALANCED BUDGET ON THE FLOOR AND

04:25:46.988 --> 04:25:47.872
VOTE FOR IT.

04:25:47.872 --> 04:25:49.190
AND MAYBE JIM JORDAN IS THE

04:25:49.190 --> 04:25:50.441
RIGHT PERSON BECAUSE HE WOULD

04:25:50.441 --> 04:25:51.842
ENDORSE THE PLAN THAT WAS BUILT

04:25:51.842 --> 04:25:53.527
BY THE TEXAS DELEGATION TO

04:25:53.527 --> 04:25:55.997
FINALLY SECURE OUR BORDER.

04:25:55.997 --> 04:25:58.966
MR. JORDAN SAID IN HIS

04:25:58.966 --> 04:26:01.535
NOMINATION THAT THERE ARE S

04:26:01.535 --> 04:26:02.536
CERTAIN BILLS THAT WE HAVE TO

04:26:02.536 --> 04:26:04.905
PASS TO FIX THE PROBLEM.

04:26:04.905 --> 04:26:06.791
THE CHALLENGE IS THE ALTERNATIVE

04:26:06.791 --> 04:26:08.309
HAS BEEN SOMEONE VOTING FOR THE

04:26:08.309 --> 04:26:11.262
VERY BILLS THAT HAVE CAUSED

04:26:11.262 --> 04:26:11.746
THESE PROBLEMS.

04:26:11.746 --> 04:26:14.131
MR. JORDAN SAYS THAT WE CANNOT

04:26:14.131 --> 04:26:16.400
ACCEPT LEGISLATION LIKE THE

04:26:16.400 --> 04:26:18.019
OMNIBUS, AND I FULLY AGREE.

04:26:18.019 --> 04:26:19.020
AND IF JIM JORDAN WERE SPEAKER

04:26:19.020 --> 04:26:20.638
OF THE HOUSE, IF HE WERE THE

04:26:20.638 --> 04:26:21.539
LEADER OF THE REPUBLICAN TEAM,

04:26:21.539 --> 04:26:24.508
WE WOULDN'T HAVE THAT

04:26:24.508 --> 04:26:25.810
CIRCUMSTANCE CHOKING THE ECONOMY

04:26:25.810 --> 04:26:28.095
OF OUR COUNTRY, INCREASING

04:26:28.095 --> 04:26:29.697
INFLATION, AND DIMINISHING THE

04:26:29.697 --> 04:26:31.082
PROSPECTS OF A BETTER LIFE FOR

04:26:31.082 --> 04:26:32.349
OUR FELLOW AMERICANS.

04:26:32.349 --> 04:26:35.119
AND FINALLY, MR. JORDAN SAID WE

04:26:35.119 --> 04:26:39.140
MUST ENGAGE IN RIGOROUS

04:26:39.140 --> 04:26:39.340
OVERSIGHT.

04:26:39.340 --> 04:26:40.274
EVERY ONE OF MY REPUBLICAN

04:26:40.274 --> 04:26:41.392
COLLEAGUES KNOWS THAT THE PERSON

04:26:41.392 --> 04:26:43.377
WHO CAN LEAD THAT OVERSIGHT

04:26:43.377 --> 04:26:44.762
EFFORT, WHO WORKS ON IT EVERY

04:26:44.762 --> 04:26:46.430
DAY, WHO HAS THE SKILL AND THE

04:26:46.430 --> 04:26:49.216
TAL EPT AND THE WILL IS JIM

04:26:49.216 --> 04:26:49.383
JORDAN.

04:26:49.383 --> 04:26:52.319
I'M NOMINATING HIM AND I'M

04:26:52.319 --> 04:26:58.259
VOTING FOR HIM.

